1637 0 obj
<</Title(How local System-One models compare to TypeSafe's Jev when assisting in the Operating Room)/Subject(Operating rooms have lots of knobs and levers to turn. Voice assistants are already common in smart homes, but reliable, real-time control is a different challenge in an operating room. I test JevK5-2B, an open-weight 2B model, running locally on my RTX 2080, and compare it with TypeSafe's Jev on a virtual operating room task. Jev is more accurate and faster in my tests, so this JevK5-2B setup doesn't yet look like a practical local alternative.)/Keywords(System One, Jev, JevK5, Medicine, Rust, Analysis)/Author(Tim Peko (TimerErTim))/Creator(Typst 0.15.1)/ModDate(D:20261024130251Z)/CreationDate(D:20261024130251Z)>>
endobj
